{"identifier":"youtube-ltfCMQeJ5NU","title":"Naruto VS Ichigo | DEATH BATTLE!","description":"It's Naruto VS Bleach in our biggest anime fight ever!Try Blue Apron! Get $30 off you first meal with FREE shipping! http://www.BlueApron.com/BattleDownload the music from this episode from iTunes today: http://apple.co/2AVj5dX You can also","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/youtube-ltfCMQeJ5NU/ltfCMQeJ5NU.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/youtube-ltfCMQeJ5NU","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/youtube-ltfCMQeJ5NU","durationMs":1683180,"level":"C2","topic":"Youtube;video;Entertainment;Death Battle;Bleach;Naruto;Ichigo;Uzukami;soul reaper ScrewAttack;versus animation;battle animation;fight animation;animated fight;DBX;Sasuke;Sakura;Orihime;anime;shonen jump;shounen jump;holy shonen trinity","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Naruto VS Ichigo | DEATH BATTLE!","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":1340,"endMs":9560,"text":"♪ Invader - Jim Johnston ♪ Wiz: The Holy Shonen Trinity...."},{"startMs":9700,"endMs":11060,"text":"The Big Three..."},{"startMs":11380,"endMs":17220,"text":"any long time reader of Shonen Jump will recognize these, some of the biggest titles in manga and anime history."},{"startMs":17500,"endMs":20820,"text":"Boomstick: And it's time for two of those Shonen heroes to throw down."},{"startMs":21200,"endMs":24440,"text":"Wiz: Naruto Uzumaki, ninja prodigy of the Hidden Leaf."},{"startMs":24660,"endMs":29500,"text":"Boomstick: And Ichigo Kurosaki, the enormously powerful Soul Reaper from \"Bleach\"."},{"startMs":29740,"endMs":31520,"text":"He's Wiz and I'm Boomstick."},{"startMs":31520,"endMs":38260,"text":"Wiz: And it's our job to analyze their weapons, armor, and skills to find out who will win...a DEATH BATTLE!"},{"startMs":42680,"endMs":46220,"text":"Wiz: Konoha, the Village Hidden in the Leaves, is a pretty quiet town."},{"startMs":46500,"endMs":49420,"text":"Boomstick: Not what I'd expect for a city full of ninja."},{"startMs":49580,"endMs":56720,"text":"Still, there was at least one troublemaker among the bunch, the number one knucklehead ninja, Naruto Uzumaki."},{"startMs":57020,"endMs":58420,"text":"Naruto: I'm home, everyone!"},{"startMs":59120,"endMs":60800,"text":"Naruto Uzumaki..."},{"startMs":61280,"endMs":64000,"text":"Has returned to the Hidden Leaf Village!"},{"startMs":64580,"endMs":71060,"text":"Wiz: Orphaned at a young age and ostracized by his peers, Naruto may have been mischievous, but he had great aspirations."},{"startMs":71060,"endMs":73940,"text":"His goal was to become the town's Hokage."},{"startMs":74160,"endMs":76540,"text":"Boomstick: Which is a fancy word for ninja governor."},{"startMs":76820,"endMs":81940,"text":"Wiz: The only way Naruto could reach such a prestigious position was to excel in ninja school."},{"startMs":82100,"endMs":83700,"text":"Boomstick: Like ninja Harry Potter."},{"startMs":83700,"endMs":89260,"text":"Though he should really find a place that'll teach him not to dress like a clown and run like a real human being."},{"startMs":89500,"endMs":91660,"text":"What does he think he is, an airplane?"},{"startMs":91840,"endMs":94460,"text":"Wiz: Actually, his posture likely decreases wind resistance."},{"startMs":94460,"endMs":99120,"text":"Which could be beneficial when moving at superhuman speeds where angular momentum is a smaller factor."},{"startMs":99120,"endMs":102860,"text":"*Boomstick's mocking gibberish* I remember when you ran like that in middle school."},{"startMs":103240,"endMs":104580,"text":"Wiz: Hey, that was for research!"},{"startMs":104820,"endMs":105740,"text":"Boomstick: Sure, Wiz."},{"startMs":106060,"endMs":111300,"text":"Anyway, while Naruto wasn't the best student, he still tried his hardest to reach his goal."},{"startMs":111300,"endMs":114440,"text":"But first, he'd have to learn how to control his chakra."},{"startMs":114840,"endMs":118840,"text":"Wiz: In Buddhism and Hinduism ideologies, chakras are, in simplistic terms..."},{"startMs":118840,"endMs":122940,"text":"gates within the human body which can be opened to achieve enlightenment."},{"startMs":122940,"endMs":127620,"text":"But the ninja in Naruto's world had a slightly... different interpretation."},{"startMs":127620,"endMs":129760,"text":"Boomstick: I'll say, they weaponized it!"},{"startMs":130000,"endMs":133360,"text":"Naruto can use chakra for all sorts of flashy attacks."},{"startMs":133360,"endMs":139660,"text":"He can heal himself, seal monsters away, walk up walls, or even stand on water like a ninja Jesus."},{"startMs":139920,"endMs":142940,"text":"Wiz: He's learned a number of chakra techniques, or jutsu's."},{"startMs":142940,"endMs":143720,"text":"Boomstick: Gesundheit."},{"startMs":143720,"endMs":145860,"text":"Wiz: And even developed a few new ones of his own."},{"startMs":145860,"endMs":153780,"text":"*fart* His signature move is the Shadow Clone Jutsu."},{"startMs":153940,"endMs":157780,"text":"Boomstick: Where he can copy and paste himself over and over and over again."},{"startMs":158080,"endMs":163080,"text":"Wiz: Unlike the standard clone technique, shadow clones are tangible, with their own combat capabilities."},{"startMs":163340,"endMs":169480,"text":"By dividing his chakra between himself and his clones, it's nearly impossible to distinguish the real Naruto from the fakes."},{"startMs":169740,"endMs":173200,"text":"Boomstick: And he can get pretty tricky when he makes thousands of 'em."},{"startMs":173540,"endMs":179180,"text":"But when strategies can't save the day he can always just beat his opponents down with the Rasengan."},{"startMs":179460,"endMs":185700,"text":"Wiz: By spinning chakra in his hand Naruto creates a compact ball of energy which can blast through solid stone."},{"startMs":185700,"endMs":191140,"text":"While the Rasengan usually takes years to learn Naruto figured it out after training for just over a week."},{"startMs":191360,"endMs":195380,"text":"Boomstick: He's invented more Rasengan's than Willy Wonka's invented candies."},{"startMs":195580,"endMs":198160,"text":"But his top pick is the Rasenshuriken."},{"startMs":198320,"endMs":205280,"text":"By combinin' the Rasengan with the element of wind he uses it to turn the spinnin' ball into a spinnin' blade."},{"startMs":205280,"endMs":211020,"text":"This baby can trap you in a vortex of wind so sharp, it'll mess you up on a cellular level."},{"startMs":211220,"endMs":217500,"text":"Wiz: Naruto has plenty of other techniques up his orange sleeves, including summoning, substitution and transformation jutsus."},{"startMs":217700,"endMs":219420,"text":"He can even transform into a..."},{"startMs":219860,"endMs":220360,"text":"uh..."},{"startMs":220500,"endMs":221600,"text":"A naked woman."},{"startMs":221740,"endMs":223100,"text":"Boomstick: Oh ho ho ho."},{"startMs":223280,"endMs":225200,"text":"Looks like he's been studyin'."},{"startMs":225500,"endMs":228220,"text":"I guess that's one plus side to not havin' parents."},{"startMs":228380,"endMs":230760,"text":"You don't need to worry about anyone walkin' in on ya."},{"startMs":231140,"endMs":234560,"text":"Wiz: While most individuals have chakra everyone has a limit."},{"startMs":234900,"endMs":239520,"text":"The more physical and spiritual energy one possesses the more chakra they'll have at their disposal."},{"startMs":239860,"endMs":242380,"text":"Boomstick: Just like the gas tank from a chainsaw."},{"startMs":242660,"endMs":251760,"text":"Wiz: Thanks to his heritage Naruto already has a great deal of chakra. Even still, he has far more than he reasonably should. All thanks to the beast within."},{"startMs":252040,"endMs":254000,"text":"Boomstick: Yeah, he's got a monster in his stomach."},{"startMs":254400,"endMs":255840,"text":"Wiz: Let's backtrack a few years..."},{"startMs":255840,"endMs":262000,"text":"On the day of Naruto's birth his village was attacked by a chakra beast known as the Nine-Tailed Fox."},{"startMs":262000,"endMs":266360,"text":"A monster so destructive a mere swing of its tails could level a mountain."},{"startMs":266360,"endMs":271580,"text":"In des peration the Hokage at the time sacrificed himself to split the Nine-Tails in two."},{"startMs":271580,"endMs":275100,"text":"Sealing one half within his own son: Naruto."},{"startMs":275100,"endMs":280340,"text":"Boomstick: So his first ever birthday gift to his son was a giant pet fox that can destroy cities?"},{"startMs":280860,"endMs":282800,"text":"*Sighs* I wish he was my dad..."},{"startMs":282800,"endMs":286480,"text":"Wiz: Eventually Naruto discovered how to communicate with the Nine-Tails."},{"startMs":286480,"endMs":288160,"text":"Boomstick: They didn't get along at first."},{"startMs":288160,"endMs":290360,"text":"Foxy would threaten to eat Naruto..."},{"startMs":290360,"endMs":292960,"text":"Naruto would whack him over the head with a big shrine gate..."},{"startMs":292960,"endMs":294900,"text":"you know typical roommate drama."},{"startMs":294900,"endMs":300300,"text":"Still they eventually became friends and Naruto learned the fox's name was Kurama."},{"startMs":300300,"endMs":304480,"text":"Wiz: Afterward, Kurama willingly shared his Chakra with Naruto on a regular basis."},{"startMs":304820,"endMs":309540,"text":"And as a being composed of Chakra, Kurama's reserves are gigantic."},{"startMs":309840,"endMs":314960,"text":"Boomstick: With so much power at his fingertips Naruto can enter a bunch of different super forms."},{"startMs":314960,"endMs":316860,"text":"First up is Sage Mode."},{"startMs":317120,"endMs":320880,"text":"Which sounds like somethin' he'd learned from an old wise man or wizard, right?"},{"startMs":321140,"endMs":321780,"text":"Nope."},{"startMs":321780,"endMs":323040,"text":"He learned it from a frog."},{"startMs":323320,"endMs":326260,"text":"Wiz: This state increases all of Naruto's physical abilities."},{"startMs":326260,"endMs":333860,"text":"Furthermore, Sage Mode allows Naruto to perceive the entire area around him and tap into naturally occurring energy via Senjutsu."},{"startMs":334020,"endMs":337620,"text":"Boomstick: He can enhance his chakra attacks by addin' natural energy."},{"startMs":337620,"endMs":340460,"text":"But if he's not careful, he'll turn into a frog."},{"startMs":340820,"endMs":342460,"text":"Nooo, I'm- I'm not kidding."},{"startMs":342860,"endMs":349960,"text":"Wiz: With Kurama's Chakra, Naruto can enter multiple Tailed Beast forms which drastically increases physical prowess and energy output."},{"startMs":350180,"endMs":352980,"text":"Boomstick: Best of which is the Nine Tails Chakra Mode."},{"startMs":353280,"endMs":354280,"text":"Flame on!"},{"startMs":354440,"endMs":361060,"text":"It got even better when he befriended Mr. Fox, upgradin' to the stronger, faster, tougher Kurama Chakra Mode."},{"startMs":361420,"endMs":368280,"text":"Wiz: Chakra Mode grants Naruto extra protection, a sense for negative emotions, and the ability to create additional Chakra arms."},{"startMs":368420,"endMs":370040,"text":"Boomstick: Whoa, that's a lot of hands!"},{"startMs":370240,"endMs":373200,"text":"Gotta wonder what kind of things he does with those, right?"},{"startMs":373420,"endMs":377720,"text":"Wiz: Oh, overwhelming attacks, extra maneuverability, creating Rasenshurikens, the works."},{"startMs":377860,"endMs":379200,"text":"Boomstick: Yeah that's not what i was..."},{"startMs":379200,"endMs":380800,"text":"*Screams* Creepy tiny hands!"},{"startMs":381060,"endMs":388240,"text":"Wiz: He can also shroud himself in a Nine-Tails-sized avatar and use Kurama's ultimate attack: the Tailed Beast Bomb."},{"startMs":388400,"endMs":391160,"text":"So destructive, it can level a mountain range."},{"startMs":391420,"endMs":394320,"text":"Boomstick: And for his final form, it's spoiler time."},{"startMs":394660,"endMs":396060,"text":"Pay attention, 'cause..."},{"startMs":396060,"endMs":396560,"text":"Yeah."},{"startMs":396560,"endMs":404140,"text":"*Clears throat* All this Chakra stuff started with an alien named Kaguya, who ate a fruit which basically created Chakra."},{"startMs":404140,"endMs":407780,"text":"Later she got all murder-happy so her sons stopped her."},{"startMs":407780,"endMs":412620,"text":"One of these sons, the Sage of Six Paths, had his own son named Asura."},{"startMs":412620,"endMs":415140,"text":"And Naruto is the reincarnation of him."},{"startMs":415740,"endMs":416620,"text":"So, yeah..."},{"startMs":417320,"endMs":418940,"text":"Naruto's kind of an alien."},{"startMs":419180,"endMs":422960,"text":"Wiz: Through this connection, Naruto was gifted the most divine form of energy."},{"startMs":423160,"endMs":424540,"text":"Six Paths Chakra."},{"startMs":424720,"endMs":427000,"text":"With it, he can enter Six Paths Sage Mode."},{"startMs":427180,"endMs":429340,"text":"Boomstick: His strength gets boosted even more."},{"startMs":429340,"endMs":432900,"text":"He can fly and he can use Truth-Seeking Balls..."},{"startMs":432900,"endMs":438380,"text":"Which are orbs of Chakra that can transform into weapons and destroy anything they touch."},{"startMs":438640,"endMs":446340,"text":"Wiz: He can combine all these forms and further add natural energy to his Kurama avatar to form Six Paths Ashura Kurama Sage Mode."},{"startMs":446780,"endMs":447280,"text":"Whew."},{"startMs":447660,"endMs":450100,"text":"Boomstick: Good God, that's a confusin' amount of forms."},{"startMs":450360,"endMs":457980,"text":"Anyway, Naruto is also an expert in hand-to-hand combat and could run faster than the eye could see when he was just 12 years old."},{"startMs":458160,"endMs":464900,"text":"Wiz: He's dodged a lightning-speed punch from the Fourth Raikage, a feat considered comparable to his father, who could teleport."},{"startMs":465160,"endMs":467720,"text":"Boomstick: He even dodged this Light-speed loogie."},{"startMs":467900,"endMs":472840,"text":"Wiz: Uh... according to the fourth databook, this Light Fang attack does indeed move at light speed."},{"startMs":472840,"endMs":475400,"text":"Over 670,000,000 miles per hour."},{"startMs":475580,"endMs":483960,"text":"Boomstick: He's tough enough to survive gettin' stabbed, have his soul ripped out, or get smacked in the face with a beam that can slice the freakin' moon apart."},{"startMs":491920,"endMs":498980,"text":"Wiz: He's fought multiple Tailed Beasts at once, lift a statue weighing several hundred tons, survived a fall from the clouds,"},{"startMs":498980,"endMs":504760,"text":"gone toe-to-toe with invisible Limbo shadows, and pulverised six falling meteorites simultaneously."},{"startMs":505000,"endMs":508320,"text":"His Chakra is so tough, he can power through Amaterasu."},{"startMs":508320,"endMs":512440,"text":"A fire Jutsu with flames so strong, they burn other flames."},{"startMs":512820,"endMs":515540,"text":"Boomstick: He could even make new eyeballs for blind people."},{"startMs":515840,"endMs":516980,"text":"What's up with that?"},{"startMs":517260,"endMs":526620,"text":"Oh, and in his final fight with rival and possibly closet-boyfriend Sasuke, their opposing power was so great, they obliterated miles upon miles of land."},{"startMs":526980,"endMs":529960,"text":"Changin' the weather and disintegratin' the lake."},{"startMs":529960,"endMs":536380,"text":"Only then, after defeating Sasuke, saving the world from Kaguya, and reuniting the split halves of Kurama..."},{"startMs":536380,"endMs":540000,"text":"Naruto finally achieved his dream and became Hokage."},{"startMs":540340,"endMs":541860,"text":"Boomstick: But he's still pretty dumb."},{"startMs":541860,"endMs":544080,"text":"I mean, he named his son Burrito."},{"startMs":544080,"endMs":544820,"text":"Wiz: Boruto."},{"startMs":545120,"endMs":546600,"text":"Boomstick: Ehh... close enough."},{"startMs":547020,"endMs":548600,"text":"Naruto: I'm not gonna run away."},{"startMs":549000,"endMs":550700,"text":"I never go back on my word."},{"startMs":551040,"endMs":552440,"text":"That's my Nindo."},{"startMs":552880,"endMs":554460,"text":"My Ninja Way!"},{"startMs":559000,"endMs":559920,"text":"Wiz: Shinigami."},{"startMs":559920,"endMs":563480,"text":"It may sound like a foreign word to some, but you all know what it is..."},{"startMs":563480,"endMs":564880,"text":"The Death God."},{"startMs":564880,"endMs":566920,"text":"The Grim Reaper of souls...."},{"startMs":566920,"endMs":570680,"text":"Boomstick: And a 17 year old ginger with a badass sword."},{"startMs":570980,"endMs":574140,"text":"Wiz: Ichigo Kurosaki seemed like a pretty normal kid growing up."},{"startMs":574140,"endMs":577280,"text":"Doing well in school and learning martial arts from his father."},{"startMs":577280,"endMs":580000,"text":"Except there was one... little... oddity...."},{"startMs":580300,"endMs":581380,"text":"He could see ghosts."},{"startMs":581620,"endMs":584060,"text":"Boomstick: Oh. it's like that kid from the Sixth Sense."},{"startMs":584320,"endMs":585820,"text":"Cole Sear: I see dead people."},{"startMs":586260,"endMs":589980,"text":"Wiz: One day, when he was nine years old and walking home with his mother..."},{"startMs":589980,"endMs":593800,"text":"young Ichigo noticed what he thought was a girl about to fall into a river."},{"startMs":593980,"endMs":598100,"text":"Boomstick: So, naturally, he ran over to rescue her like the brave little kid he was."},{"startMs":598360,"endMs":600840,"text":"Wiz: Except it wasn't really a girl at all."},{"startMs":601000,"endMs":605060,"text":"It was a Hollow, a monster spawned from an abandoned human soul."},{"startMs":605320,"endMs":607220,"text":"And it promptly killed his mother."},{"startMs":607500,"endMs":608140,"text":"Boomstick: Bummer."},{"startMs":608440,"endMs":611560,"text":"Reminds me of how I lost my poor Mama Boomstick."},{"startMs":611560,"endMs":615480,"text":"*sniffs* Ah she always hated that ghost in the barn."},{"startMs":615680,"endMs":616580,"text":"Wiz: Rrrrriiiiight..."},{"startMs":616580,"endMs":621660,"text":"Well Ichigo remained ignorant of the truth until year's later, when he met a woman named Rukia."},{"startMs":621660,"endMs":625840,"text":"Who held the illustrious job title of Shinigami, or Soul Reaper."},{"startMs":626100,"endMs":631320,"text":"A guardian of the dead who keeps the balance in the universe by helping those who have passed move on to the afterlife."},{"startMs":631640,"endMs":634100,"text":"Otherwise, they turn into violent Hollows."},{"startMs":634420,"endMs":641340,"text":"Boomstick: And if you show up late to work and it doesn't work out, the Soul Reaper can always cut Hollows down with their awesome swords."},{"startMs":641340,"endMs":643420,"text":"Like samurai Ghostbusters."},{"startMs":643420,"endMs":648480,"text":"Anyway, the two of 'em got into a bind and Rukia had to share some of her power with Ichigo."},{"startMs":648480,"endMs":651380,"text":"Turns out he was a surprise Soul Reaper all along."},{"startMs":651940,"endMs":652940,"text":"Convenient."},{"startMs":652940,"endMs":659960,"text":"Wiz: When accessing his Shinigami power, Ichigo leaves his physical body for a new one made up of Reishi, or spiritual matter."},{"startMs":659960,"endMs":664360,"text":"Which makes him invisible to anyone in the living world, despite still being physically present."},{"startMs":664560,"endMs":667420,"text":"Boomstick: And his new powers make him super deadly."},{"startMs":667420,"endMs":675840,"text":"He could move with blindin' speed, cut through giant monsters with ease, survive bein' punched through whole city blocks, and even fly through the air."},{"startMs":676060,"endMs":680780,"text":"Wiz: It's more accurate to say he walks through the air, using naturally occurring Reishi as footholds."},{"startMs":680920,"endMs":683280,"text":"Boomstick: But let's get to the dicey part of his getup."},{"startMs":683480,"endMs":684880,"text":"That awesome sword."},{"startMs":684880,"endMs":688680,"text":"It's a Zanpakuto, a blade connected to its owner's soul."},{"startMs":688680,"endMs":690780,"text":"It may look like an oversized steak knife..."},{"startMs":690780,"endMs":693100,"text":"but it's a Soul Reaper's best friend."},{"startMs":693340,"endMs":698660,"text":"Wiz: Every Shinigami possesses a Zanpakuto spirit within themselves, which manifests as their sword."},{"startMs":698660,"endMs":700660,"text":"Ichigo's is called Zangetsu."},{"startMs":700660,"endMs":701880,"text":"Well... both of them are."},{"startMs":702220,"endMs":703940,"text":"Boomstick: Ooooohhhh, here we go."},{"startMs":703940,"endMs":706900,"text":"Strap in, 'cause this shit's about to get crazy."},{"startMs":707260,"endMs":713440,"text":"Wiz: Ichigo actually has two different Zanpakuto spirits drawn from his weird and confusing heritage."},{"startMs":713920,"endMs":718480,"text":"Boomstick: All right, some long story short, Ichigo's a Soul Reaper because his dad is too."},{"startMs":718480,"endMs":722220,"text":"But he's also part Quincy... which is a human with Reishi powers."},{"startMs":722220,"endMs":724160,"text":"Because that's what his mom was."},{"startMs":724420,"endMs":729800,"text":"Buuut... he's also part Hollow, because his mom was possessed by a Hollow called White."},{"startMs":729800,"endMs":732260,"text":"And White got passed onto him when he was born."},{"startMs":732260,"endMs":736240,"text":"Oh, and he's also part Fullbringer, but nobody cares about Fullbringers."},{"startMs":736460,"endMs":744720,"text":"Wiz: One of Ichigo's inner spirits as a manifestation of his Quincy side inherited from his mother, while the other is a fusion of his Shinigami power and the Hollow."},{"startMs":744720,"endMs":748660,"text":"Unfortunately, Shinigami and Quincy go together like oil and water."},{"startMs":748920,"endMs":756440,"text":"Boomstick: While trying to find a balance between these two sides, Ichigo learned plenty of neat techniques, like his bread and butter attack."},{"startMs":756440,"endMs":758140,"text":"The Getsuga Tenshō."},{"startMs":758420,"endMs":759260,"text":"Ichigo: GETSUGA..."},{"startMs":760240,"endMs":761640,"text":"TENSHO!!!"},{"startMs":764800,"endMs":768540,"text":"Wiz: By concentrating his reiatsu, or spiritual pressure, through his sword..."},{"startMs":768540,"endMs":771360,"text":"Ichigo can launch a massive slashing attack."},{"startMs":771360,"endMs":772900,"text":"Boomstick: Call it like it is, Wiz."},{"startMs":772900,"endMs":774400,"text":"It's a sword beam."},{"startMs":774400,"endMs":779620,"text":"And Ichigo can charge it up fire, from up close, or even blast two of 'em at once."},{"startMs":779620,"endMs":785360,"text":"Wiz: From his Quincy side, Ichigo has used Blut Vene, a temporary defense which grants inhuman durability."},{"startMs":785720,"endMs":792820,"text":"From his Shinigami training, he developed exceptional sword skills and learned Shunpo, or Flash Step, which greatly enhances his speed."},{"startMs":793120,"endMs":796280,"text":"Boomstick: But there's one really big deal we haven't talked about yet."},{"startMs":796500,"endMs":797340,"text":"Ichigo: BANKAI!"},{"startMs":799420,"endMs":806720,"text":"Wiz: Over the course of his career, battling hollows and protecting his friends; Ichigo has attained many... MANY different super-powered forms."},{"startMs":806900,"endMs":809400,"text":"Starting with the base Shinigami form: Shikai."},{"startMs":809700,"endMs":818160,"text":"Despite essentially being Ichigo's base, this form is strong enough to block an attack from the Sōkyoku, said to have power equal to 1 million Zanpakuto."},{"startMs":818400,"endMs":825460,"text":"Boomstick: The next step was Bankai, normally it takes 10 years to reach this form but Ichigo did it in just 2 days."},{"startMs":825460,"endMs":826760,"text":"*Laughing* Like a boss."},{"startMs":826760,"endMs":831720,"text":"Wiz: When using Bankai, ones power can grow anywhere from 5, to 10 times greater."},{"startMs":831720,"endMs":836240,"text":"And according to the official data book, while in Bankai, Ichigo moves \"like lightning.\""},{"startMs":836580,"endMs":839600,"text":"Boomstick: Wait, why does his sword shrink when he goes Bankai?"},{"startMs":839600,"endMs":841620,"text":"Shouldn't it be bigger since he's stronger?"},{"startMs":841880,"endMs":842860,"text":"Wiz: Technically, yes."},{"startMs":842860,"endMs":845980,"text":"But Ichigo can control its size to keep it more manageable."},{"startMs":845980,"endMs":850840,"text":"If Shinigami couldn't minimize their blades, some would have swords the size of skyscrapers."},{"startMs":851060,"endMs":852200,"text":"Boomstick: Awesome."},{"startMs":852200,"endMs":855800,"text":"Anyway, the Hollow inside wanted a piece of the action too."},{"startMs":855800,"endMs":859520,"text":"So Ichigo gained a new power boost with a spoopy Hollow mask."},{"startMs":859820,"endMs":865360,"text":"This form is strong enough to lift five iron pillars, each weighing nearly 100 tons."},{"startMs":865360,"endMs":868540,"text":"Wiz: Though if he's not careful, the Hollow can take control of his body..."},{"startMs":868540,"endMs":872600,"text":"Sending him into a violent berserker state commonly referred to as Vasto Lorde."},{"startMs":872800,"endMs":878600,"text":"Despite the lack of consciousness, Vasto Lorde Ichigo could heal quickly, and was strong enough to overcome Ulquiorra."},{"startMs":878920,"endMs":880940,"text":"Who's powerful enough to nuke a city."},{"startMs":881180,"endMs":886220,"text":"Boomstick: After some quality training with his dad, Ichigo got a sort-of-second Bankai."},{"startMs":886220,"endMs":888660,"text":"Which most people call Dangai Ichigo."},{"startMs":888920,"endMs":896100,"text":"In this form, he shattered mountains without even trying, he broke through the Black Coffin attack which distorts time and space."},{"startMs":896100,"endMs":897660,"text":"Which sounds like a black hole."},{"startMs":898040,"endMs":903720,"text":"Right after that, he survived a shot so frickin' big, the explosion could be seen for miles."},{"startMs":904000,"endMs":907460,"text":"Wiz: By comparing this crater to those left by real-life bomb tests..."},{"startMs":907460,"endMs":913060,"text":"I'd estimate the attack to have a maximum explosive yield of 814 kilotons of TNT."},{"startMs":913300,"endMs":916600,"text":"That's like Ichigo surviving 54 Little Boys to the face."},{"startMs":916600,"endMs":918800,"text":"*Boomstick laughs* *Boomstick laughs* Wiz: N-! No, no no no!!!"},{"startMs":918800,"endMs":921780,"text":"*Boomstick laughs* Wiz: I meant... I meant the bomb f-from... from 1945, not the..."},{"startMs":921780,"endMs":922500,"text":"Wiz: Oh, God..."},{"startMs":923160,"endMs":925460,"text":"*Boomsticks sighs with delight* Boomstick: Well..."},{"startMs":925460,"endMs":930400,"text":"Try as those \"Little Boys\" might, all it did to Ichigo was burn his arm."},{"startMs":930400,"endMs":931820,"text":"And he didn't even care!"},{"startMs":931820,"endMs":933920,"text":"This guy isn't the type to give up."},{"startMs":934200,"endMs":939200,"text":"Wiz: For his ultimate attack, Dangai Ichigo literally becomes the Getsuga Tenshō itself."},{"startMs":939540,"endMs":941360,"text":"I know that's confusing but just roll with it."},{"startMs":941360,"endMs":944420,"text":"To summon the incredibly powerful Mugetsu."},{"startMs":944640,"endMs":948260,"text":"Boomstick: Which busted up one of the biggest baddies in the whole series."},{"startMs":948580,"endMs":951800,"text":"Buut, it also sacrificed all of Ichigo's powers."},{"startMs":952140,"endMs":953560,"text":"Well, that's a raw deal."},{"startMs":953560,"endMs":960300,"text":"But 17 months later, he managed to get them back with Fullbringer powers, which enhanced his physical abilities."},{"startMs":960620,"endMs":962060,"text":"But then he lost those too."},{"startMs":962060,"endMs":967960,"text":"Wiz: It's worth noting that, while in Fullbring Shikai, his normal sword swings were as strong as his old Getsuga Tenshō."},{"startMs":968260,"endMs":969860,"text":"Boomstick: But he still didn't give up."},{"startMs":969860,"endMs":975780,"text":"After training with some top-tier Soul Reapers and eatin' some food, which gave him Super Reiatsu..."},{"startMs":975780,"endMs":976920,"text":"the moment came..."},{"startMs":976920,"endMs":984200,"text":"In the most epic quenchin' of all time, an entire sea disintegrated to form his new true Shikai."},{"startMs":984360,"endMs":986100,"text":"Complete with not one..."},{"startMs":986100,"endMs":988280,"text":"But two Zangetsu swords."},{"startMs":988580,"endMs":994740,"text":"Wiz: Finally balancing the Shinigami, the Hollow, and the Quincy within, Ichigo had reached his full potential."},{"startMs":994740,"endMs":998600,"text":"He tamed his Vasto Lorde form, merging it with his Quincy side."},{"startMs":998600,"endMs":1005140,"text":"In this form, he can combine his Getsuga Tenshō with one of the strongest Hollow attacks: the Gran Rey Cero."},{"startMs":1005440,"endMs":1010520,"text":"Boomstick: He also made a trip that normally takes a week, in only 9 hours and 15 minutes."},{"startMs":1010520,"endMs":1014520,"text":"And last but not least, he achieved a brand new level of Bankai."},{"startMs":1015000,"endMs":1019940,"text":"Boomstick: Which was immediately crushed by some old dude who planned to destroy the universe named..."},{"startMs":1019940,"endMs":1020880,"text":"Ye watch...?"},{"startMs":1021200,"endMs":1022340,"text":"Yoooou... watch...?"},{"startMs":1022340,"endMs":1023000,"text":"Ehhhh..."},{"startMs":1023000,"endMs":1023700,"text":"Ewok?"},{"startMs":1023700,"endMs":1030280,"text":"Wiz: Mmmm... It's probably inspired by the H ebrew name for God, \"Yahweh\" an- and the katakana ends with a sharp \"kuh\" sound, so..."},{"startMs":1031160,"endMs":1032080,"text":"\"Yuhwach\"...?"},{"startMs":1032340,"endMs":1034140,"text":"Boomstick: Yeah, wach ya gonna do?"},{"startMs":1034140,"endMs":1037860,"text":"Well, we can assume this Bankai worked similar to his old ones."},{"startMs":1037860,"endMs":1042380,"text":"Increasing its physical speed and strength along with his Reiatsu, tenfold."},{"startMs":1042380,"endMs":1046540,"text":"Even without his Bankai, he still cut mustache-man to shreds."},{"startMs":1046780,"endMs":1049380,"text":"Wiz: And then he lived happily ever after..."},{"startMs":1049980,"endMs":1051840,"text":"Until his kid became a Soul Reaper..."},{"startMs":1051980,"endMs":1054040,"text":"Boomstick: Yeah, what he named him, \"Bitchigo\"?"},{"startMs":1054200,"endMs":1054700,"text":"Wiz: What?"},{"startMs":1054700,"endMs":1055200,"text":"NO!"},{"startMs":1055200,"endMs":1055700,"text":"It's Kazui."},{"startMs":1055860,"endMs":1060760,"text":"Boomstick: Uh, I might've got it mixed up with the other... uh... enchilada kid, or whatever."},{"startMs":1060900,"endMs":1062380,"text":"Wiz: Eh... Close enough..."},{"startMs":1062840,"endMs":1065780,"text":"Ichigo: Now I'm Ichigo Kurosaki, substitute Soul Reaper."},{"startMs":1065780,"endMs":1071060,"text":"And I'm combining my powerful spirit energy with this blade in order to protect my FRIENDS!"},{"startMs":1073940,"endMs":1075940,"text":"Wiz: All right, the combatants are set."},{"startMs":1076040,"endMs":1078260,"text":"Let's end this debate once and for all!"},{"startMs":1078440,"endMs":1082420,"text":"But first, did you know that Naruto and Ichigo are named after food?"},{"startMs":1082760,"endMs":1085940,"text":"Maybe you can find 'em in your next bash from Blue Apron."},{"startMs":1089760,"endMs":1096280,"text":"Grandpappy Boomstick always said that: \"Nothing in life is better than good food and makin' somethin' with your own two hands.\""},{"startMs":1096400,"endMs":1099060,"text":"And Blue Apron is both those things combined."},{"startMs":1099300,"endMs":1103100,"text":"Wiz: Blue Apron is the #1 fresh ingredient and recipe delivery service in the country."},{"startMs":1103460,"endMs":1107160,"text":"All ingredients arrive right to your door guaranteed fresh and ready to cook."},{"startMs":1107340,"endMs":1113500,"text":"Boomstick: It's better than eatin' fast food plus It's affordable; Blue Apron is less than $10 per person per meal."},{"startMs":1113660,"endMs":1116840,"text":"Wiz: Choose from a variety of recipes and get the meals that sound good to you."},{"startMs":1117100,"endMs":1120440,"text":"The ingredients are purposely proportioned and the instructions are easy to follow."},{"startMs":1120600,"endMs":1122460,"text":"I mean even Boomstick can do it!"},{"startMs":1122760,"endMs":1126300,"text":"Boomstick: Hey, watch it! Or you're not getting any to the next meal I make when it arrives."},{"startMs":1126440,"endMs":1131560,"text":"Wiz: Well then I'll make the crispy wild Alaskan Pollock and garlic mashed potatoes with roasted broccoli and tartar sauce myself."},{"startMs":1131620,"endMs":1137240,"text":"And if you're worried about variety? Don't bother recipes are not repeated within the year so you'll never get bored."},{"startMs":1137400,"endMs":1149040,"text":"Check out this week's menu and get $30 off your first order with free-shipping by going to BlueApron.com/BATTLE Boomstick: You'll love how good it feels and taste to create incredible home-cooked meals with Blue Apron."},{"startMs":1149220,"endMs":1149840,"text":"So don't wait."},{"startMs":1150100,"endMs":1154660,"text":"Wiz: That's BlueApron.com/BATTLE Boomstick: Blue Apron a better way to cook."},{"startMs":1154900,"endMs":1159640,"text":"But right now... IT'S TIME FOR A DEATH BATTLEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE!!!"},{"startMs":1171460,"endMs":1174200,"text":"Ichigo: (thinking) What's that energy? Is that a hollow?"},{"startMs":1174980,"endMs":1177960,"text":"Kurama: Naruto, I sense a presence."},{"startMs":1179580,"endMs":1181120,"text":"Naruto! Wake up!"},{"startMs":1182980,"endMs":1183480,"text":"Announcer: FIGHT!"},{"startMs":1187500,"endMs":1188700,"text":"Naruto: Woah! He's invisible!"},{"startMs":1191760,"endMs":1192780,"text":"Ichigo: He can't see me?"},{"startMs":1193280,"endMs":1193780,"text":"Good..."},{"startMs":1203740,"endMs":1205220,"text":"Quit running, coward!"},{"startMs":1209140,"endMs":1212040,"text":"Kurama: Naruto, keep moving! I'll direct you..."},{"startMs":1218720,"endMs":1219520,"text":"Ichigo: You're dead!"},{"startMs":1219980,"endMs":1220640,"text":"Naruto: Oh!"},{"startMs":1222060,"endMs":1222880,"text":"Ichigo: How the heck-!?"},{"startMs":1223700,"endMs":1224700,"text":"Naruto (clones): RASENGAN!"},{"startMs":1228260,"endMs":1229420,"text":"Naruto (Tailed Beast Mode): I see you!"},{"startMs":1229920,"endMs":1231020,"text":"BELIEVE IT!"},{"startMs":1238420,"endMs":1239300,"text":"Ichigo: Bring it on!"},{"startMs":1240240,"endMs":1241020,"text":"GETSUGA..."},{"startMs":1241600,"endMs":1242500,"text":"Ichigo (Hollow Mask): TENSHO!!!"},{"startMs":1259520,"endMs":1260220,"text":"Naruto (Tailed Beast Form): Transform!"},{"startMs":1263300,"endMs":1264000,"text":"Ichigo (Hollow Mask): Really?"},{"startMs":1266040,"endMs":1267480,"text":"Naruto (Clones in Tailed Beast Form): RASENSHURIKEN!!!"},{"startMs":1267940,"endMs":1269000,"text":"Ichigo (Hollow Mask): BANKAI!"},{"startMs":1273920,"endMs":1274420,"text":"Ichigo (True Bankai): Yo!"},{"startMs":1274740,"endMs":1277280,"text":"Not bad, but I'm still gonna beat your ass!"},{"startMs":1281040,"endMs":1281820,"text":"Naruto (Tailed Beast Form): AHHH!"},{"startMs":1283940,"endMs":1285560,"text":"Ichigo (True Bankai): Give me a freakin break..."},{"startMs":1294980,"endMs":1297740,"text":"(breathing) Is that the best you can do?"},{"startMs":1306320,"endMs":1307020,"text":"Ichigo (Saigo no Getsuga Tenshō): Mugetsu!"},{"startMs":1309700,"endMs":1314020,"text":"Naruto (Tailed Beast Mode): (gasps) Naruto: KURAMA!!!"},{"startMs":1340300,"endMs":1341060,"text":"Ichigo: Screw you..."},{"startMs":1341560,"endMs":1343280,"text":"BASTARD!!!"},{"startMs":1347500,"endMs":1348000,"text":"Naruto: Phew."},{"startMs":1348240,"endMs":1349460,"text":"Who was that guy?"},{"startMs":1352120,"endMs":1356980,"text":"Announcer: KO Boomstick: Damn even without his powers Ichigo never gave up."},{"startMs":1357280,"endMs":1358320,"text":"What a badass!"},{"startMs":1358500,"endMs":1363740,"text":"Wiz: Sorry Bleach fans I know you all really wanted to win but unfortunately this wasn't it."},{"startMs":1364020,"endMs":1368020,"text":"Boomstick: Naruto had better training, a broader arsenal and a better healing factor."},{"startMs":1368200,"endMs":1371160,"text":"And Ichigo's invisible ghost body didn't really matter."},{"startMs":1371380,"endMs":1376540,"text":"Wiz: Shinigami may be invisible, but they're still present in the physical realm and can be touched by normal people."},{"startMs":1376720,"endMs":1382180,"text":"Kurama can locate individuals by simply sensing their emotions and Naruto's even seen his own soul before."},{"startMs":1382360,"endMs":1389120,"text":"Boomstick: And with Six Paths power he can see and fight Madara's Limbo Clones even though they were on a totally separate plane of existence."},{"startMs":1389280,"endMs":1394780,"text":"Wiz: Also keep in mind that while chakra and reishi have fairly different uses they both contain spiritual energy."},{"startMs":1395060,"endMs":1399980,"text":"Boomstick: Let's talk speed. Naruto can dodge lightspeed attacks and can move faster than lightning."},{"startMs":1400080,"endMs":1404120,"text":"A lightning bolt's return stroke is 220,000,00 miles per hour."},{"startMs":1404220,"endMs":1405600,"text":"'Bout one-third the speed of light."},{"startMs":1405720,"endMs":1409620,"text":"Ichigo has also displayed lightning-fast speeds and even greater."},{"startMs":1409860,"endMs":1413360,"text":"Wiz: Near the end of the series Ichigo took a trip that should have taken seven days."},{"startMs":1413520,"endMs":1416260,"text":"But instead took 9 hours, and 15 minutes."},{"startMs":1416440,"endMs":1420240,"text":"It's like Kirinji here was referencing his accomplices' speed."},{"startMs":1420440,"endMs":1426960,"text":"Boomstick: Like Ichibē who can knock his foes 2440 miles away and appear next to him in a second."},{"startMs":1427160,"endMs":1432280,"text":"Yhwatchy guy beat him by goin' twice as fast so we'll use that as Ichibē's limit."},{"startMs":1432280,"endMs":1438780,"text":"Wiz: With that we can get the trip's total distance and conclude Ichigo's top speed is 319 million miles per hour."},{"startMs":1439080,"endMs":1440880,"text":"That's massively hypersonic."},{"startMs":1440960,"endMs":1442340,"text":"But not quite lightspeed."},{"startMs":1442540,"endMs":1447580,"text":"Boomstick: Still there's a difference between travel speed and reaction speed as Naruto's already shown."},{"startMs":1447720,"endMs":1453900,"text":"Comparin' them directly Ichigo's best reaction should clock in at around 970 million miles per hour."},{"startMs":1454120,"endMs":1457800,"text":"40% faster than lightspeed and Naruto's reaction time."},{"startMs":1457980,"endMs":1459440,"text":"All right, point for Ichigo!"},{"startMs":1459780,"endMs":1461520,"text":"Wiz: Speed alone wasn't enough though."},{"startMs":1461640,"endMs":1468140,"text":"Especially since Naruto's Sage powers gave him superb field awareness, making it difficult for Ichigo to land a fatal blow."},{"startMs":1468380,"endMs":1470700,"text":"Boomstick: If he could even land somethin' fatal at all."},{"startMs":1470820,"endMs":1475080,"text":"Wiz: Ichigo has always had a tough time damaging foes who have stronger spiritual energy than him."},{"startMs":1475220,"endMs":1478660,"text":"With that said let's compare his Reiatsu to Naruto's chakra."},{"startMs":1479120,"endMs":1485280,"text":"Boomstick: Bad news is, across both of 'em the only multiplier we know for sure is Ichigo's times ten Bankai."},{"startMs":1485380,"endMs":1492860,"text":"The times ten is difficult to achieve, but for Ichigo's sake, let's assume he gets the maximum possible boost from every transformation."},{"startMs":1492980,"endMs":1504980,"text":"Wiz: His other forms likely don't boost his stats this much. For example, when he used his Hollow Mask to barely over power an Arrancar, The situation and its results were similar to his then-comparable Shinigami friends releasing their limiters."},{"startMs":1505140,"endMs":1507780,"text":"Which gave each of them a boost of x5."},{"startMs":1507960,"endMs":1515860,"text":"However let's give the benefit of the doubt and apply the maximum x10 increase to all of Ichigo's forms that clearly increased his fighting potential."},{"startMs":1515860,"endMs":1520100,"text":"As well as stack them even though many forms were in unconnected power sets."},{"startMs":1520320,"endMs":1523920,"text":"Boomstick: For the sake of argument we're deliberately overestimating Ichigo's power."},{"startMs":1524060,"endMs":1524860,"text":"You'll see why."},{"startMs":1524980,"endMs":1526160,"text":"Wiz: So here's our formula."},{"startMs":1526320,"endMs":1527280,"text":"But where do we start?"},{"startMs":1527680,"endMs":1532400,"text":"Okay. Bankai Ichigo with his Hollow Mask was on par with Ulquiorra's first transformation, correct?"},{"startMs":1532800,"endMs":1533860,"text":"Boomstick: Well nearly."},{"startMs":1534040,"endMs":1539180,"text":"Wiz: Ulquiorra states his new form can destroy the City of Las Noches in the Hollow World of Hueco Mundo."},{"startMs":1539400,"endMs":1541280,"text":"Boomstick: What's that? Like Mexican hell?"},{"startMs":1541560,"endMs":1542120,"text":"Wiz: Well..."},{"startMs":1542260,"endMs":1543100,"text":"There is a wall."},{"startMs":1543380,"endMs":1544220,"text":"Boomstick: Haha!"},{"startMs":1545160,"endMs":1550540,"text":"Wiz: Las Noches is square in shape and takes three days to walk from one corner to a gate in the center of the wall."},{"startMs":1550780,"endMs":1554120,"text":"So it has a total area of 200,000 square miles."},{"startMs":1554240,"endMs":1560780,"text":"Boomstick: That's bigger than California and destroyin' it in one go needs over 400,000 megatons of tnt."},{"startMs":1561000,"endMs":1563920,"text":"Wiz: So plug that into the formula and there you have it."},{"startMs":1564000,"endMs":1568960,"text":"Ichigo's Reiatsu is equal to over 440 billion megatons of TNT."},{"startMs":1569220,"endMs":1572820,"text":"Boomstick: Thankfully, Naruto's chakra level is much easier to figure out."},{"startMs":1572960,"endMs":1576720,"text":"Wiz: His chakra was once extracted and burst a hole through the hollow moon."},{"startMs":1576720,"endMs":1581760,"text":"He survived the explosion and it was explicitly said that this was nearly all of his chakra."},{"startMs":1582060,"endMs":1584220,"text":"Sakura: Most of his chakra has been siphoned off."},{"startMs":1585200,"endMs":1592080,"text":"Wiz: By measuring the aftermath from both sides we found the blast to equal at least 480 billion megatons of TNT."},{"startMs":1592220,"endMs":1594280,"text":"40 billion more than Ichigo."},{"startMs":1594440,"endMs":1597120,"text":"Boomstick: And don't forget we were deliberately overestimatin' him."},{"startMs":1597320,"endMs":1599740,"text":"Wiz: Also, this was Base form Naruto."},{"startMs":1599860,"endMs":1602260,"text":"Not including any increases from additional modes."},{"startMs":1602420,"endMs":1609540,"text":"Which allowed him to block an attack that cut the moon in half, a force that had to be over 27 trillion megatons."},{"startMs":1609740,"endMs":1615560,"text":"This proves Naruto can both output and survive a blast stronger than Ichigo is capable of."},{"startMs":1615740,"endMs":1619860,"text":"Boomstick: If you're thinkin': \"Wait, Boomstick! Ichigo survived a Black Hole in a box!\"."},{"startMs":1620020,"endMs":1622760,"text":"That move doesn't really work like a black hole."},{"startMs":1622940,"endMs":1627680,"text":"Wiz: Plus the 814 kiloton Fragor blast did hurt him immediately after."},{"startMs":1627680,"endMs":1629480,"text":"So it must have been weaker than that."},{"startMs":1629780,"endMs":1634340,"text":"Boomstick: But Wiz weren't Kaguya and Ywa waka waka planet bursters?"},{"startMs":1634440,"endMs":1635840,"text":"Don't they scale to them?"},{"startMs":1635900,"endMs":1636400,"text":"Wiz: Nope."},{"startMs":1636580,"endMs":1640880,"text":"Kaguya's planet busting attack required chakra from nearly the entire Earth's population."},{"startMs":1641040,"endMs":1641900,"text":"Not just her own."},{"startMs":1642100,"endMs":1647280,"text":"And while Yhwach's power was pretty OP he couldn't destroy the world through his own destructive capability."},{"startMs":1647580,"endMs":1652140,"text":"He only planned to manipulate the delicate balance between life and death by stopping the flow of souls."},{"startMs":1652360,"endMs":1657060,"text":"Like a plate spinning on a stick if one side gets too heavy the whole thing comes crashing down."},{"startMs":1657300,"endMs":1665460,"text":"Boomstick: To sum it up, Ichigo had the speed, they both had the guts and Naruto had the strength, durability, training and abilities for days."},{"startMs":1665980,"endMs":1669220,"text":"Naruto sure got the Shonen Jump on Ichigo."},{"startMs":1669540,"endMs":1671960,"text":"Wiz: The winner is: Naruto Uzumaki."},{"startMs":1674620,"endMs":1677480,"text":"Ben: Stick around we're about to announce the combatants for the next DEATH BATTLE!"},{"startMs":1677480,"endMs":1681560,"text":"Chad: And if you wanna watch the exclusive commentary on this episode click that little box over there and start a FIRST membership trial."},{"startMs":1681780,"endMs":1683180,"text":"Ben: You should try grab one of these shirts too."}]}